      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "86075 source files, 10.3M lines\nthe compiler without its tests is 4631k of that\n\ngcc             7866k   The compiler\nlibgcc           328k   The runtime the compiler emits calls to, for division, unwinding and more\nlibstdc++-v3    1137k   The C++ standard library\nlibgomp          158k   The OpenMP and OpenACC runtime\nlibsanitizer     111k   The address and undefined behaviour sanitizer runtimes, from LLVM\nlibcpp            62k   The preprocessor\nlibiberty         50k   Portability shims and the C++ symbol demangler\ninclude           24k   Headers shared between the compiler and the libraries\nfixincludes       12k   Patches for broken system headers\nlto-plugin         1k   The plugin the linker loads so link time optimization can work\ncontrib            3k   Scripts\nthe rest         627k   Twenty odd more runtimes, one per language, plus the build machinery",
      "originalText": "86075 source files, 10.3M lines\nthe compiler without its tests is 4631k of that\n\ngcc             7866k   The compiler\nlibgcc           328k   The runtime the compiler emits calls to, for division, unwinding and more\nlibstdc++-v3    1137k   The C++ standard library\nlibgomp          158k   The OpenMP and OpenACC runtime\nlibsanitizer     111k   The address and undefined behaviour sanitizer runtimes, from LLVM\nlibcpp            62k   The preprocessor\nlibiberty         50k   Portability shims and the C++ symbol demangler\ninclude           24k   Headers shared between the compiler and the libraries\nfixincludes       12k   Patches for broken system headers\nlto-plugin         1k   The plugin the linker loads so link time optimization can work\ncontrib            3k   Scripts\nthe rest         627k   Twenty odd more runtimes, one per language, plus the build machinery",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "box004",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
